The '''Revenant Catalyst''' is an {{Epic}} item dropped by the [[Revenant Horror]] {{SlayerTier|II}} or higher after obtaining {{CollectionLink|Zombie Slayer|6}}. The chances of it dropping are {{Odds|Extraordinary}}. This [[Slayer Catalyst]] can be used to craft the [[Reaper Falchion]] and [[Reaper Armor]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Zombie Slayer LVL 6 ===
1 Revenant Catalyst can be claimed once as a reward from {{Coll|Zombie Slayer LVL 6}}.

=== Revenant Horror ===
A {{Stier|2}}+ [[Revenant Horror]] has a {{Odds|Extraordinary}} to drop 1 Revenant Catalyst if the player has reached {{Coll|Zombie Slayer LVL 6}}.
;Drop Chances
*{{Stier|2}}: 1.01% (1/99)
*{{Stier|3}}: 1.01% (1/99.48)
*{{Stier|4}}: 1.01% (1/99.616)
*{{Stier|5}}: 0.86% (1/116.216)

